  "protocolVersion": null,
  "instructions": "fresnel edits Apple Liquid Glass app icons stored as .icon bundles (the Icon Composer format). Typical flow: icon_create → icon_add_layer (one 1024×1024 SVG per element) → icon_set (glass, translucency, dark/tinted overrides) → icon_render_sheet to look at all appearances → icon_validate → icon_export. Read fresnel://guide/icon-design for Apple design rules. Targets are \"document\", \"<Group>\" or \"<Group>/<Layer>\" (names or #index; index 0 is frontmost). Previews are approximations of the system renderer.",
  "durationMs": 6464,
  "stderr": "fresnel-mcp 0.2.2 ready (roots: /pkg)\n"
